rd I looked only at the big numbers (\"עד 2%\", \"לא גובים\") and skipped the grey sub-labels. I ignored every teal \"חוקים וכללים · N\" pill, the KH/PF codes, the dotted underlines (I didn't tap them) and the grey tags in the glossary.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n\n- \"מס רווחי הון\"\n- \"גבול הפטור\" and the 15,712 / 20,566 numbers\n- \"צמודה / לא צמודה\"\n- \"הוצאות ישירות\"\n- \"קצבה\"\n- \"קופת גמל\" (the page uses it to explain what a keren is)\n- What \"מחושב\" vs \"ממקור\" means\n- The orange box whose start I never saw\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n\n- **A number.** For example: \"with a salary of X, after 6 years you'd have about Y.\" The calculator should do this, but in what I saw it's closed.\n- What percentage my employer usually puts in versus me. It's hinted at the cut-off top of screen 2, but I couldn't read it.\n- Which company or track to pick, or at least which one most people my age choose.\n- Whether it's bad to leave it in past 6 years, or whether I should.\n\n## 7. If half had to go\n\nFirst to go: the glossary at the bottom, \"מי מציע ומי מצטרף\", \"משיכה ומעבר\" (except the 4 days), the treasury economist paragraph, the orange box, \"כדאי להכיר גם\", and all the \"חוקים וכללים\" pills.\n\nI'd keep: the top line, the 6-years paragraph, the calculator (opened, with a number), S&P 500 in the track list, \"בפועל 0.34% עד 0.74%\" and \"הפסד בהשקעות הוא שלכם\".","ttft_ms":1462,"type":"result","duration_ms":39094,"uuid":"b302aff0-be90-4ba2-8488-8f8624a018ac","ttft_stream_ms":997,"time_to_request_ms":309,"first_content_frame_ms":997,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":3928,"cacheReadInputTokens":35553,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21106,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2545506,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":538,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":21106,"canonicalModel":"c